      "userJourney": "Journey 1\n1. Onboarding: Open https://byggab-businesswallet.igrant.io > \"Register as the business owner\". Scan QR with EUDI Wallet, present PID, accept Bygg AB Business Wallet Authenticator.\n2. Login: Press \"Sign in with your EUDI Wallet\", present Authenticator.\n3. Add People: Go to People, add user, choose payment attestation (Account/Card with Mastercard or Visa). User opens email, scans QR (or presses button), enters 4-digit code, accepts in wallet. Refresh to show Accepted/Linked.\n\nJourney 2\n1. Onboarding: Open https://webuildshop-corporate-demo.igrant.io/register > Business. Search European Digital Directory (\"bygg\", VAT, EBWOID) > Connect. Sign into Bygg portal, review claims and Trusted Service Provider details, share. Scan QR with EUDI Wallet (present PID) to get WE BUILD Shop Corporate Authenticator.\n2. Login: Sign in at shop with EUDI Wallet (business mode), present Corporate Authenticator.\n3. Payment: Add items to cart > Checkout. Press \"Pay with EUDI Wallet\", select credential (Journey 1 or https://piggybank-demo.igrant.io), approve TS12 payment.\n4. eReceipt: Open https://byggab-businesswallet.igrant.io, click notification bell, accept eReceipt. View under Receipts.",
